==========================================================================
2D Navier-Stokes (vorticity-streamfunction) -- convergence study
==========================================================================
domain [0, 2pi)^2  |  nu = 0.1  |  Fourier pseudo-spectral + RK4
Taylor-Green exact solution used as the reference (see module docstring).

(1) Temporal convergence at fixed N = 32, T = 1.0
          dt    max|omega_num - omega_exact|
         0.2                    1.397945e-05
         0.1                    8.517524e-07
        0.05                    2.751954e-11
       0.025                    1.712852e-12
    order between dt=0.2 and dt=0.1: 4.0367
    order between dt=0.1 and dt=0.05: 14.9177
    order between dt=0.05 and dt=0.025: 4.0060
    min observed temporal order = 4.0060  (RK4 -> ~4)

(2) Spatial convergence, smooth blob IC, nu = 0.05, T = 0.2, dt = 1e-3
         grid pair      max|coarse - fine|
       32 -> 64               1.264768e-07
       64 -> 128              3.269095e-08
      128 -> 256              8.070901e-09
    (error falls by roughly 4x per doubling of N; see the caveats below)

(3) Discrete enstrophy decay for the Taylor-Green solution, N = 32
          t      Z(t) numeric      exp(-4 nu t)
      0.000      1.0000000000      1.0000000000
      0.167      0.9353822591      0.9355069850
      0.333      0.8749399706      0.8751733190
      0.500      0.8187307531      0.8187307531
      0.667      0.7658262214      0.7659283384
      0.833      0.7163402610      0.7165313106
      1.000      0.6703200460      0.6703200460
    measured decay rate = 0.400029   analytic 4*nu = 0.4
    relative error      = 7.143e-05

==========================================================================
SCOPE / CAVEATS
==========================================================================
* This measures DISCRETISATION ORDER only; it proves no theorem.
* 2D smooth solutions of these equations are known to exist for all
  time. We report only N in [32, 64, 128, 256] and dt in [0.2, 0.1, 0.05, 0.025].
* The 3D Navier-Stokes regularity problem is NOT addressed here and
  remains open.

Total wall time: 15.76 s
